# What goes to Vercel: the app shell and nothing else. Everything is left out first and
# only the files the page loads come back, so a file dropped into web/ by accident (a
# local figure folder, Meta's Muse artwork, a note with an address) never gets deployed.
/*
!/index.html
!/*.js
!/style.css
!/manifest.webmanifest
!/vercel.json
!icons
!demo
!figure-default

# Never, wherever it sits: the owner's figure frames and any local frame folder.
muse_*.png
*.apng
local/
figure/
frames/
.DS_Store
